    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "5804e337-3e35-4281-b0dc-3d9e7acae268",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Toxic Flowers of the Jungle",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COLOMBIA",
        "PublicId": "112772085072",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/colombia/scene_hippo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository be565b8d-3ba9-419c-9551-47e06cff57a4).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Santa Fortuna 47!\rSpring is coming and all around the jungle many exotic plants are blooming. The locals have known for generations, that the flowers outside their village can produce a lethal toxin. Since our client wants this job to be clean, I suggest you look into this a little further. Maybe you find a way to use these flowers to create a tasteless, traceless experience for your targets.\rGood Luck!\r\rCreator: Jan",
